WEBVTT

00:08.133 --> 00:10.302
Give me the quest.

00:10.385 --> 00:11.678
The secret quest.

00:11.762 --> 00:13.764
I told you to give it to me!

00:14.139 --> 00:17.351
Even if you say so...

00:17.434 --> 00:19.645
This receptionist said it just now.

00:20.604 --> 00:23.815
Our counter doesn't handle
the so-called secret quest.

00:23.899 --> 00:26.318
Stop giving me that textbook answer.

00:26.401 --> 00:28.320
You're hiding it, aren't you?

00:28.529 --> 00:31.698
What an arrogant receptionist!

00:31.782 --> 00:33.867
There’s no way I can come up with that!

00:33.951 --> 00:35.035
After all, the secret quest

00:35.118 --> 00:38.038
is just a ridiculous rumor
among adventurers.

00:38.121 --> 00:40.499
In reality, there's no such thing!

00:41.250 --> 00:43.210
The quests managed
by the Adventurer's Guild

00:43.293 --> 00:45.003
are all posted on the quest board.

00:45.587 --> 00:47.339
Don't talk back to me!

00:48.882 --> 00:51.635
Why don't I just beat him up?

00:51.927 --> 00:53.136
You wench!

00:53.637 --> 00:57.015
Is this how you treat
a respected adventurer?

00:57.641 --> 00:59.977
Let go of your hand, Slay.

01:01.478 --> 01:03.105
It's you, Silver Sword.

01:05.524 --> 01:07.693
Are you trying to show off?

01:07.776 --> 01:09.778
You pretty boy!

01:15.158 --> 01:16.451
Let go of me!

01:16.702 --> 01:18.078
If you dare lay a hand on Ms. Alina...

01:18.412 --> 01:20.205
on a receptionist again,

01:20.455 --> 01:22.624
I won't let you off the hook as easily.

01:22.916 --> 01:24.418
Damn it!

01:25.002 --> 01:26.378
I'll get you for this!

01:32.009 --> 01:35.512
Ms. Alina, thank you for your help.

01:35.596 --> 01:36.763
Don't mention it.

01:36.847 --> 01:38.682
Let me know if anything happens again.

01:39.141 --> 01:40.809
Are you all right, Ms. Alina?

01:41.018 --> 01:41.852
Yes.

01:41.935 --> 01:44.396
Thank you for your help.

01:44.771 --> 01:47.065
There are many dangerous
adventurers like him.

01:47.399 --> 01:49.484
Don't provoke them too much.

01:50.027 --> 01:51.361
You're right.

01:51.862 --> 01:53.363
I'll be more careful from now on.

01:54.406 --> 01:55.949
By the way, Mr. Silver Sword,

01:56.283 --> 01:59.161
what brings you to our counter today?

01:59.369 --> 02:00.829
Well, that's...

02:01.371 --> 02:04.124
You didn't come all the way here
for no reason, did you?

02:04.208 --> 02:06.418
I was just passing by.

02:06.877 --> 02:09.213
It's time for me to go home.

02:09.296 --> 02:11.048
That's too bad.

02:11.340 --> 02:14.760
Please do come again to Ifuru Counter.

02:17.387 --> 02:19.640
(The Next Day)

02:26.480 --> 02:28.774
That's why I saw her face.

02:29.191 --> 02:30.609
Ms. Alina Clover.

02:36.532 --> 02:38.242
He found me out.

02:39.493 --> 02:41.203
In order to shut him up,

02:41.286 --> 02:43.997
I guess I have to make him suffer a bit.

02:44.081 --> 02:46.583
No, despite the way he acts,

02:46.667 --> 02:48.627
he's a big shot in the Guild.

02:49.586 --> 02:51.004
If I lay a finger on him,

02:51.088 --> 02:53.173
I'll still be fired in the end.

02:54.675 --> 02:56.885
I'm so done.

02:56.969 --> 02:58.470
I just want to do nothing.

02:58.554 --> 03:00.305
I want to escape from reality.

03:00.389 --> 03:02.683
I don't want to go outside.

03:05.936 --> 03:08.564
How I wish I could
lounge around at home forever.

03:10.732 --> 03:11.733
However,

03:12.067 --> 03:14.236
I was able to get a loan for this house

03:14.570 --> 03:17.197
because I'm a receptionist
with a safe job and a high credit score.

03:22.744 --> 03:23.787
Sure enough,

03:23.871 --> 03:25.622
a receptionist is the best job.

03:25.956 --> 03:28.500
I'll never get myself fired!

03:34.006 --> 03:39.845
(I May Be a Guild Receptionist,
but I'll Solo Any Boss to Clock Out on Time)

05:04.179 --> 05:07.599
Jeez, what's with that guy?

05:08.350 --> 05:12.688
Don't keep loitering at the quest counter.

05:12.771 --> 05:14.606
Is he trying to piss me off?

05:15.190 --> 05:17.568
This is a nice spot.

05:18.110 --> 05:20.112
It's quiet, and there's no one else.

05:20.529 --> 05:22.990
I didn't know Ifuru had
such a secret spot.

05:23.657 --> 05:25.409
Skill Activate!

05:26.577 --> 05:28.829
I-I didn't do anything!

05:28.912 --> 05:29.788
Shut up!

05:29.872 --> 05:32.749
It's finally my lunch break,
but you're interrupting again!

05:33.041 --> 05:34.418
Hey, Ms. Alina.

05:34.835 --> 05:37.462
When did your Dia skill manifest?

05:42.843 --> 05:43.844
I'm not telling you.

05:44.386 --> 05:47.598
As of now, no one knows
what it takes to manifest skills.

05:47.890 --> 05:49.725
Basically, it's just luck.

05:50.100 --> 05:51.894
It wasn't easy for you to manifest it.

05:52.144 --> 05:55.314
Don't you think it's a waste of talent
to work as a Guild Receptionist?

05:55.898 --> 05:57.024
Anyway,

05:57.107 --> 05:59.610
it's pointless for you
to hang around at my workplace.

05:59.985 --> 06:01.195
I will

06:01.278 --> 06:03.071
never join Silver Sword!

06:07.117 --> 06:08.702
Why did God

06:08.785 --> 06:11.830
make a receptionist
manifest some kind of skill?

06:18.086 --> 06:19.671
Two summers ago,

06:22.925 --> 06:24.384
in the town of Ifuru,

06:24.676 --> 06:26.929
the annual Centenary Festival
was being held.

06:27.012 --> 06:29.681
The lively event lasted
for three days and nights.

06:31.099 --> 06:31.934
However,

06:32.017 --> 06:34.353
I had just become a receptionist.

06:34.686 --> 06:35.979
I wasn't used to the work,

06:36.063 --> 06:38.065
so I was working overtime
like crazy every day.

06:39.983 --> 06:41.443
I want to go home.

06:42.110 --> 06:43.987
I want to go to the festival.

06:46.698 --> 06:47.783
I can't take it anymore.

06:49.409 --> 06:50.994
On the day of the Centenary Festival,

06:51.411 --> 06:53.664
the one who wishes the strongest

06:53.747 --> 06:56.500
will be blessed by Dia, right?

06:58.126 --> 06:59.378
God.

06:59.878 --> 07:01.171
I beg of you.

07:01.547 --> 07:03.882
Please free me from working overtime.

07:13.308 --> 07:14.685
I'm finally done.

07:14.768 --> 07:16.645
I'd be happy with just a quick look.

07:23.527 --> 07:24.528
What?

07:32.369 --> 07:33.662
It's over.

07:37.833 --> 07:40.669
I've been working so hard.

07:41.795 --> 07:44.047
I'm the only one who worked so hard.

07:44.798 --> 07:46.925
Whether it's the Guild increasing rewards,

07:47.426 --> 07:50.387
incompetent adventurers
who can't defeat the boss,

07:50.470 --> 07:52.222
or bosses left undefeated for too long,

07:52.306 --> 07:55.184
I hate all these reasons
forcing me to work overtime.

07:57.811 --> 07:59.271
I don't care what it is.

08:00.355 --> 08:03.233
I'll do anything to stop working overtime.

08:04.026 --> 08:06.528
I want a great power.

08:07.112 --> 08:08.405
And then

08:08.488 --> 08:10.240
knock away

08:10.324 --> 08:11.658
everything in my way!

08:16.038 --> 08:17.414
What is this?

08:22.836 --> 08:24.087
Damn it!

08:24.338 --> 08:25.964
That receptionist.

08:26.048 --> 08:28.383
I'm going to beat the crap out of her!

08:29.009 --> 08:31.220
This is one heck of a prey.

08:31.303 --> 08:33.847
A raid boss? That's pretty impressive.

08:33.931 --> 08:34.973
Well, yeah.

08:39.102 --> 08:42.689
How can I get Ms. Alina to look at me?

08:43.148 --> 08:44.399
No.

08:44.483 --> 08:46.818
How can I get her to join Silver Sword?

08:48.028 --> 08:49.029
What's that sound?

08:49.571 --> 08:50.405
What happened?

08:50.489 --> 08:51.698
What's wrong?

09:04.795 --> 09:05.796
That's...

09:10.717 --> 09:12.052
(Enchanting Light)
Hastor!

09:12.052 --> 09:13.050
(Enchanting Light)

09:17.224 --> 09:18.225
I've aggroed him!

09:18.684 --> 09:20.519
While it's focusing on me,

09:20.602 --> 09:21.478
get out of here now!

09:21.562 --> 09:23.230
You can't handle it alone!

09:23.313 --> 09:24.940
He's a raid boss after all!

09:25.023 --> 09:25.858
What?

09:25.941 --> 09:28.694
We brought it back by hypnosis
to collect materials,

09:28.777 --> 09:30.946
but it suddenly went berserk!

09:33.073 --> 09:34.491
You're finally here, Silver Sword.

09:34.575 --> 09:35.659
Slay.

09:35.742 --> 09:37.828
Isn't my skill amazing?

09:38.120 --> 09:39.997
I'm the one controlling it.

09:40.414 --> 09:42.833
It's going berserk in its dream right now.

09:43.166 --> 09:45.752
I'm going to crush you,
that infuriating receptionist,

09:45.836 --> 09:49.089
and this whole town!

09:50.591 --> 09:51.884
It's Death Crush!

09:51.967 --> 09:53.427
Everyone, run!

09:53.802 --> 09:55.721
I have to do something
to block this attack.

09:57.598 --> 09:58.932
Skill Activate!

09:59.016 --> 10:00.601
(Guardian of the Iron Wall)
Sigurth Wall!

10:04.354 --> 10:05.898
This guy's attack.

10:05.981 --> 10:07.649
I'll tank it!

10:08.400 --> 10:11.278
My idiot boss!

10:11.695 --> 10:15.741
"Remember to submit a complaint report
by the end of the day," what the heck?

10:15.824 --> 10:17.576
Are you kidding me?

10:17.659 --> 10:19.786
I'll have to work overtime then!

10:24.583 --> 10:26.418
Jeez!

10:26.502 --> 10:29.087
How annoying! What's all the commotion?

10:29.713 --> 10:31.632
Is it that guy again?

10:31.715 --> 10:34.635
He's a whiny customer
who doesn't understand a word.

10:34.718 --> 10:36.970
It's not surprising that he did this.

10:38.764 --> 10:39.598
What?

10:39.681 --> 10:40.682
That direction!

10:40.766 --> 10:42.184
Could it be...

10:42.684 --> 10:44.853
No, no, no!

10:44.937 --> 10:47.147
It can't be!

10:47.231 --> 10:48.649
It's impossible!

10:48.732 --> 10:50.692
Absolutely no way!

10:57.241 --> 10:59.952
My house.

11:00.911 --> 11:02.287
My mortgage.

11:04.706 --> 11:07.793
I still have 30 years left!

11:19.137 --> 11:20.597
That

11:20.681 --> 11:23.642
damn whiny customer!

11:27.604 --> 11:28.981
I will kill you!

11:33.277 --> 11:36.697
It doesn't matter how many
of you small fries come at me!

11:38.949 --> 11:41.118
We don't have enough attack power.

11:41.201 --> 11:42.411
What should I do?

11:50.043 --> 11:50.878
What?

11:53.088 --> 11:54.089
Ali...

11:54.381 --> 11:55.716
The Executioner?

11:55.966 --> 11:59.720
Isn't this the one
the Guild is desperately looking for?

11:59.803 --> 12:01.430
If I kill you,

12:01.513 --> 12:04.224
those bunch at the Guild
will be furious, right?

12:05.559 --> 12:08.020
My healing place...

12:08.103 --> 12:09.062
What?

12:09.688 --> 12:11.190
That house

12:11.273 --> 12:13.525
is the only place
that can heal my body and mind

12:13.609 --> 12:15.736
after a long, exhausting day at work.

12:15.819 --> 12:18.322
It's like an oasis in modern society.

12:19.448 --> 12:22.075
And it was heaven to me.

12:24.203 --> 12:25.370
I'll kill you!

12:26.413 --> 12:28.624
How dare you destroy my paradise?

12:28.707 --> 12:30.459
You deserve to die!

12:30.542 --> 12:32.794
Go to hell!

12:32.878 --> 12:34.379
Knock him down!

12:34.463 --> 12:36.131
Clay Golem!

12:36.507 --> 12:37.758
Apologize with your death!

12:37.841 --> 12:40.969
You giant rock!

12:45.724 --> 12:46.725
What?

12:51.396 --> 12:52.689
No way.

12:55.901 --> 12:57.736
Don't come near me!

12:57.819 --> 12:59.238
You monster!

12:59.780 --> 13:01.406
Didn't anyone

13:01.490 --> 13:03.909
teach you

13:04.326 --> 13:06.703
not to destroy other people's things?

13:06.787 --> 13:07.621
You

13:07.704 --> 13:11.667
nasty, whiny customer!

13:20.384 --> 13:21.510
This is

13:21.593 --> 13:23.554
really badly damaged.

13:23.846 --> 13:26.223
This is too much.

13:27.641 --> 13:30.978
How am I going
to live from tomorrow onwards?

13:31.895 --> 13:33.522
Uh, Ms. Alina.

13:36.400 --> 13:37.401
Tonight,

13:37.901 --> 13:39.486
do you want to stay at my place?

13:39.820 --> 13:41.864
Don't say such weird things.

13:41.947 --> 13:44.241
I'm staying at an inn, of course.

13:44.867 --> 13:46.994
Because of that damn whiny customer,

13:47.077 --> 13:49.413
I still have to work overtime.

13:49.872 --> 13:51.540
Get out of my sight.

13:55.043 --> 13:57.838
So the Executioner showed up here?

13:58.255 --> 14:00.757
Yes, that's what I heard.

14:00.841 --> 14:04.303
I'm grateful that he protected Ifuru,

14:04.595 --> 14:07.514
but now that he's appeared in the city,
his luck has run out.

14:07.598 --> 14:09.516
Skill Activate.

14:10.726 --> 14:12.936
(Time Observer)
Sigurth Chronos.

14:12.936 --> 14:14.230
(Time Observer)

14:18.483 --> 14:20.027
Not only was my house destroyed,

14:20.110 --> 14:21.737
but I also had to work overtime.

14:21.820 --> 14:23.238
That whiny customer.

14:23.322 --> 14:25.032
I'm going to curse his ancestors!

14:25.115 --> 14:28.118
I don't know what to say,

14:28.952 --> 14:30.913
but keep your spirits up, Ms. Alina.

14:30.996 --> 14:33.582
Didn't I tell you to disappear?

14:33.665 --> 14:35.417
Why are you still here?

14:35.751 --> 14:37.794
After what happened this afternoon,

14:37.878 --> 14:39.004
it's safer to stay behind.

14:42.466 --> 14:43.342
He's always like this,

14:43.425 --> 14:45.385
but he's an executive of the Guild.

14:45.469 --> 14:48.305
That's why he has access to the office.

14:48.555 --> 14:51.517
But on a day like today,

14:51.600 --> 14:53.894
it's better to go home and rest.

14:54.311 --> 14:55.604
That's right.

14:55.687 --> 14:57.314
"I'm not in the mood today."

14:57.397 --> 14:59.274
"I'll do it when I feel like it,"
whatsoever.

14:59.358 --> 15:01.401
I once thought that way before.

15:02.361 --> 15:03.362
But

15:03.737 --> 15:04.738
I realized that

15:04.988 --> 15:06.657
cleaning up after today's laziness

15:06.740 --> 15:08.158
will still be tomorrow's me!

15:08.242 --> 15:10.869
Most importantly,
when it comes to working overtime,

15:10.953 --> 15:14.164
there's no way I can muster
even an ounce of motivation!

15:14.248 --> 15:15.165
If that's the case,

15:15.249 --> 15:16.542
I might as well finish it today

15:16.625 --> 15:19.002
and go home on time tomorrow!

15:19.086 --> 15:23.257
I really can't tell
if you're motivated or not.

15:24.216 --> 15:25.050
By the way,

15:25.133 --> 15:26.593
I've already organized these documents.

15:27.135 --> 15:28.136
Already?

15:28.595 --> 15:30.389
There were some missing parts
and errors in the documents.

15:30.472 --> 15:31.765
I've also corrected them.

15:34.059 --> 15:35.811
Not only is the content correct,

15:35.894 --> 15:37.855
but the order is also perfect.

15:38.730 --> 15:39.898
This guy.

15:39.982 --> 15:41.024
So he's the quick-witted type

15:41.108 --> 15:44.111
who can immediately grasp everything
with just a little hint.

15:44.528 --> 15:46.071
On the other hand,

15:46.154 --> 15:48.198
I'm totally the clumsy type

15:48.282 --> 15:51.910
who can't master anything
without making a mistake first.

15:54.496 --> 15:55.330
You piss me off.

15:55.414 --> 15:56.248
What?

15:57.332 --> 15:58.667
I said you're pissing me off.

15:58.750 --> 16:01.128
I've been working hard for three years.

16:01.211 --> 16:03.630
But you surpassed me in an instant!

16:03.714 --> 16:05.757
People like you

16:05.841 --> 16:09.386
piss me off the most!

16:11.680 --> 16:14.975
Why is the world so unreasonable?

16:15.058 --> 16:16.268
No, that's not it.

16:16.351 --> 16:20.314
It's because you taught me well.

16:21.231 --> 16:24.109
Life is unfair from birth.

16:24.693 --> 16:25.736
Okay.

16:25.819 --> 16:27.613
Leave the rest to me.

16:27.696 --> 16:29.114
I'll take care of everything for you.

16:29.198 --> 16:33.911
That hurts my pride as a receptionist!

16:33.994 --> 16:34.995
Oh, right.

16:35.078 --> 16:37.456
Sweets are the best when you're tired.

16:38.707 --> 16:39.708
This...

16:40.709 --> 16:43.170
is the thing Ms. Alina crushed earlier.

16:44.379 --> 16:45.839
What about the Relic?

16:45.923 --> 16:47.549
There's something written inside.

16:47.633 --> 16:50.594
Quest... accept?

16:51.678 --> 16:52.971
Get back!

16:58.185 --> 16:59.895
What is this?

17:00.979 --> 17:03.982
The location is the Chalk Tower.

17:04.066 --> 17:08.278
The achievement condition
is defeating all the floor bosses.

17:08.362 --> 17:12.282
Confirm acceptance of this quest
based on the above-mentioned conditions.

17:16.078 --> 17:18.497
That was a request form, wasn't it?

17:18.997 --> 17:20.165
I think so.

17:20.541 --> 17:22.501
Chalk Tower.

17:23.043 --> 17:24.628
I've never heard of it before.

17:24.711 --> 17:27.047
Yes, it's strange.

17:27.422 --> 17:29.842
Well then, I'll give you that weird Relic.

17:29.925 --> 17:32.219
I hope the Silver Sword works hard
to crack the puzzle.

17:32.845 --> 17:34.263
Ms. Alina.

17:34.346 --> 17:37.224
You're pretending you didn't see
the request form, aren't you?

17:37.599 --> 17:38.767
Of course.

17:38.851 --> 17:40.894
It looks like a hassle.

17:40.978 --> 17:42.771
I don't want anything to do with it.

17:42.855 --> 17:45.107
Yes, you're right.

17:46.024 --> 17:47.025
Anyway,

17:47.734 --> 17:49.111
I'll look into it.

17:50.028 --> 17:53.115
(The Next Day)

17:53.740 --> 17:56.285
Why does it always turn out like this?

17:56.368 --> 17:58.620
The way Lord Executioner acted yesterday

17:58.704 --> 18:00.372
was extremely cool.

18:00.747 --> 18:03.542
There's a large feature in the newspaper.

18:04.126 --> 18:05.419
That's right.

18:07.921 --> 18:10.132
Ms. Alina, could it be that you're

18:10.215 --> 18:11.508
the Executioner...

18:11.592 --> 18:12.593
What?

18:14.761 --> 18:17.139
An Executioner stan, right?

18:18.182 --> 18:19.892
Executioner stan?

18:20.225 --> 18:22.060
Come on, I'm asking you.

18:22.144 --> 18:25.022
Are you a Jade stan
or an Executioner stan?

18:25.105 --> 18:26.732
Right now, Lord Executioner's popularity

18:26.815 --> 18:30.652
is no less than Lord Jade's.

18:30.736 --> 18:31.737
What?

18:31.820 --> 18:33.238
To be honest,

18:33.322 --> 18:36.033
I'm stanning the Executioner too.

18:36.116 --> 18:37.701
He's never shown his face though.

18:37.784 --> 18:40.746
I'm sure the person
under that hood is handsome.

18:40.829 --> 18:42.789
It's already an established fact!

18:43.332 --> 18:46.460
He's now the hero who saved Ifuru.

18:46.543 --> 18:48.295
Even if they offered him a reward,

18:48.378 --> 18:50.214
he wouldn't come forward.

18:50.297 --> 18:53.133
My goodness, he's so cool!

18:53.467 --> 18:56.970
I want him to hit me with his war hammer.

18:58.722 --> 19:00.933
I mean, to protect me, of course.

19:01.016 --> 19:02.017
Besides,

19:02.100 --> 19:04.895
I never thought I'd get to see him
in a dream collaboration with Lord Jade.

19:04.978 --> 19:06.188
The strongest handsome tank

19:06.271 --> 19:08.565
and the strongest handsome attacker!

19:08.815 --> 19:12.236
It really gets your imagination running!

19:12.736 --> 19:16.114
Well, I'm glad you're happy.

19:30.879 --> 19:33.549
Guild Master Glen Garia?

19:34.299 --> 19:38.595
That Executioner guy is pretty active.

19:38.929 --> 19:41.515
He's got me curious.

19:43.600 --> 19:46.895
Why is he coming this way?

19:47.729 --> 19:49.481
How are things at the counter lately,

19:49.565 --> 19:51.692
Miss Cute Receptionist?

19:51.775 --> 19:54.069
No, there's not much of a problem.

19:54.152 --> 19:56.822
I see. That's good.

19:57.364 --> 19:58.365
By the way,

19:58.448 --> 20:00.868
do you know what my skill is?

20:01.118 --> 20:02.452
Of course.

20:02.536 --> 20:03.912
Your Sigurth skill, Sigurth Chronos,

20:03.996 --> 20:05.747
can not only stop time at the scene,

20:05.831 --> 20:08.417
but can also allow you
to see into the past.

20:10.627 --> 20:12.004
That's right.

20:12.087 --> 20:14.339
As expected of a receptionist.

20:15.591 --> 20:16.592
That means

20:16.675 --> 20:18.969
he can use his skill to return to the time
the Executioner appeared in the square

20:19.052 --> 20:21.221
and see the face under the hood?

20:23.307 --> 20:25.058
It's not convenient to talk here.

20:25.517 --> 20:27.352
Meet me at the Guild's Headquarters.

20:30.230 --> 20:33.192
(Adventurer's Guild Headquarters)

20:34.318 --> 20:35.569
I got found out.

20:36.028 --> 20:38.155
I got found out.

20:38.238 --> 20:40.324
I always felt like
I'd get found out one day,

20:40.407 --> 20:41.992
but it seems that day has come.

20:42.075 --> 20:43.452
I'm going to be fired.

20:43.827 --> 20:46.163
The Guild Master looks scary,

20:46.246 --> 20:48.332
but if you explain it to him,
he won't blame you.

20:48.415 --> 20:49.750
Shut up, you snitch.

20:49.833 --> 20:52.252
I didn't snitch! Please believe me!

20:52.461 --> 20:54.421
I hate you.

20:54.505 --> 20:56.882
Go stub your toe
on a dresser corner and die.

20:57.716 --> 21:01.094
You hate me.

21:01.178 --> 21:04.515
You used to tell me
to go to hell and get lost,

21:04.598 --> 21:09.311
but you never said you hated me.
That was my only salvation.

21:09.645 --> 21:10.604
It sounds like

21:10.687 --> 21:13.148
she hates you right from the start...

21:14.274 --> 21:17.778
Don't rub it in when a man's down.

21:18.779 --> 21:20.405
I'm just being honest.

21:20.489 --> 21:22.741
A man in love is sensitive.

21:23.492 --> 21:25.536
Has Jade fallen in love?

21:26.036 --> 21:30.541
The Jade who remains unfazed by beauties
throwing themselves at him is actually...

21:30.999 --> 21:32.626
I want to cheer him on,

21:32.709 --> 21:34.294
but it's hopeless
no matter how I look at it...

21:35.504 --> 21:38.298
Lululi!

21:40.384 --> 21:41.760
By the way,

21:41.844 --> 21:45.138
is this girl really the Executioner?

21:45.222 --> 21:48.016
She looks like
an ordinary receptionist to me.

21:48.934 --> 21:51.854
(Adventurer's guild training grounds)

21:54.898 --> 21:57.651
Sorry for asking you
to come all the way here.

22:00.195 --> 22:02.322
What do you want to say?

22:03.407 --> 22:06.493
No matter how I look at her, she just
seems like an ordinary receptionist.

22:06.910 --> 22:09.413
Do you know how surprised I was

22:09.496 --> 22:11.957
when I saw the Executioner's face
with my skill?

22:12.457 --> 22:15.335
Did you call me here just to tell me that?

22:20.465 --> 22:22.259
Let's have a duel,

22:22.342 --> 22:23.427
Executioner.

22:25.012 --> 22:26.096
What?

23:58.605 --> 23:59.565
Next episode.

23:59.648 --> 24:01.024
I may be Silver Sword's tank,

24:01.108 --> 24:03.485
but I'll take on
a high-difficulty dungeon.

24:03.485 --> 24:05.480
(Next Episode: I May Be Silver Sword's Tank,
But I'll Take on a High-difficulty Dungeon)
